{
  "title": "Lovely Juicy French Vegetable Gratin",
  "description": "A delicious and romantic French dish featuring mixed vegetables in a yeasty and juicy gratin, perfect for a special occasion. This slow-cooked recipe is raw-friendly and bursting with flavor.",
