  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, combine sliced zucchini, bell peppers, onions, garlic, and mushrooms.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together diced tomatoes, olive oil, mixed spice, yeast, salt, and pepper.",
    "Pour the tomato mixture over the vegetable mixture and toss to coat.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 20 minutes, or until the top is golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
